--- Asymmetric operations (TEE_AsymmetricEncrypt, TEE_AsymmetricDecrypt, TEE_AsymmetricSignDigest,
--- TEE_AsymmetricVerifyDigest): the call moves to final and the request goes to the handle. Each
--- search is a bounded example driver.

load ./src/main
load ./tests/api/aux

set show command off .
set print attribute off .
set print color off .

mod SEED-ASYMMETRIC is
  pr TEST-AUX .
endm

--- [SEED-ASYM-ENCRYPT-CALL] asymmetric-encrypt moves the call to final
search [1] in SEED-ASYMMETRIC :
  < ta : TAKernel | status : (normal).AppStatus, api-call : init(AsymmetricEncrypt[# oid(101, ta) # randomData]), counter : 0 >
=>*
  < ta : TAKernel | api-call : final(AsymmetricEncrypt[# oid(101, ta) # randomData]) > .

--- [SEED-ASYM-DECRYPT-CALL] asymmetric-decrypt moves the call to final
search [1] in SEED-ASYMMETRIC :
  < ta : TAKernel | status : (normal).AppStatus, api-call : init(AsymmetricDecrypt[# oid(101, ta) # randomData]), counter : 0 >
=>*
  < ta : TAKernel | api-call : final(AsymmetricDecrypt[# oid(101, ta) # randomData]) > .

--- [SEED-ASYM-SIGN-CALL] asymmetric-sign-digest moves the call to final
search [1] in SEED-ASYMMETRIC :
  < ta : TAKernel | status : (normal).AppStatus, api-call : init(AsymmetricSignDigest[# oid(101, ta) # randomData]), counter : 0 >
=>*
  < ta : TAKernel | api-call : final(AsymmetricSignDigest[# oid(101, ta) # randomData]) > .

--- [SEED-ASYM-VERIFY-CALL] asymmetric-verify-digest moves the call to final
search [1] in SEED-ASYMMETRIC :
  < ta : TAKernel | status : (normal).AppStatus, api-call : init(AsymmetricVerifyDigest[# oid(101, ta) # randomData # randomData]), counter : 0 >
=>*
  < ta : TAKernel | api-call : final(AsymmetricVerifyDigest[# oid(101, ta) # randomData # randomData]) > .
